      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Music, resume & recovery",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Optional background music\n\n`LoadAudio` is **bypassed** (ctrl+B, purple) by default so the workflow runs with the\nnative MiniMax H3 Foley and dialogue only.\n\nTo add a music bed: pick a file, press **ctrl+B** to un-bypass, then choose a mix mode\non the renderer:\n\n- **blend with video audio** - music sits under the native audio at `music_gain`.\n- **ducking under video audio** - music auto-attenuates whenever dialogue or loud Foley plays.\n- **replace video audio** - native audio is discarded, only the music is kept.\n\n## Resume / crash recovery\n`save_segments` + `resume` are on. Every finished segment is written to\n`output/storyteller/MiniMaxH3_segment_001.mp4`, `_002.mp4` and so on - clean numbered files\nyou can use on their own. Each one gets a small `.json` beside it recording how it was made.\n\nRe-queue after a stop and finished segments are reloaded from disk instead of re-rendered.\nChange the prompt, seed, size, steps or the shifts and that segment renders again.\n\n**To redo one bad segment:** put its number in `rerender_segments` (e.g. `3`, or `2, 5-7`)\nand queue. Everything else is reused.\n"
      ]
    },
